      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——关于如何向世人展现她的名字\n所需要做的事情，我昨晚思考了一整夜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f87c77316d54123bc7f4fb2c5e4b0049afd1d807deff2de60562292c258f37e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
