    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b0f1ee49af217b6ab82e90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他们由衷地期盼着机伶金花能够大放异彩，\n并全心全意地为她准备了惊喜。\n而那份心意，也确确实实地化为了她的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7661621a81b213ddcddb015b42fbe589d4eb64410fc199a320580db8f64621f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134315.json",
      "json_path": [
